            {
                "category": "summary",
                "text": "NVIDIA has released a software update for NVIDIA\u00ae  Unified Fabric Manager (UFM).&nbsp;<div>To protect your system, follow instructions to clone or update this software to version 6.24 or later from the <a href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/networking/infiniband/ufm/\">UFM NVIDIA Application Hub</a>.</div>",
                "title": "Summary"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "Refer to Security Updates for the updated versions to install.",
                "title": "Mitigation Notes"
            },
            {
                "category": "details",
                "text": "These issues were found internally.",
                "title": "Bulletin Notes"
            },
